NOTE ON INTENDED USE

SciForensics is a screening and triage aid. Its output is probabilistic
evidence, not a determination of misconduct. Any allegation of research
misconduct requires human expert review of the original, full-resolution
source material. See docs/MODEL_CARD.md for measured performance and known
failure modes.

The datasets this project trains and evaluates on (BBBC038, BioFors, the
Polimi western-blot corpus) carry their own licences and citation
requirements, which are not superseded by this licence. See
docs/DATA_CARD.md.
